   001273               *****                                                        *****                                           
   001274               ***** 8000-CHECK-DB2-CONNECTION MUST BE PERFORMED EACH AND   *****                                           
   001275               ***** EVERYTIME A DB2 PROGRAM IS ENTERED OR EXECUTED, AND IT *****                                           
1PP 5655-EC6 IBM Enterprise COBOL for z/OS  6.2.0 P190522       GP004760  Date 02/10/2020  Time 07:53:30   Page    27                
   LineID  PL SL  ----+-*A-1-B--+----2----+----3----+----4----+----5----+----6----+----7-|--+----8 Map and Cross Reference           
0  001276               ***** MUST BE BEFORE THE FIRST SQL STATEMENT IN THE PROGRAM  *****                                           
   001277               ***** EXECUTED.                                              *****                                           
   001278               *****                                                        *****                                           
   001279               ******************************************************************                                           
   001280                                                                                                                            
   001281               *8000-CHECK-DB2-CONNECTION.                                                                                  
   001282                                                                                                                            
   001283               *****EXEC SQL                                                                                                
   001284               *****     INCLUDE DB85102L                                                                                   
   001285               *****END-EXEC.                                                                                               
   001286                                                                                                                            
   001287               *****************************************************************                                            
   001288               *    DB85102L.  BEGINNING OF INCLUDE COPYBOOK MEMBER DB85102L.  *                                            
   001289               *****************************************************************                                            
   001290                                                                                                                            
   001291                8000-CHECK-DB2-CONNECTION.                                                                                  
   001292                                                                                                                            
   001293               *****************************************************************                                            
   001294               *    8000-CHECK-DB2-CONNECTION MUST BE PERFORMED EACH AND       *                                            
   001295               *    EVERYTIME A DB2 PROGRAM IS ENTERED OR EXECUTED, AND IT     *                                            
   001296               *    MUST BE BEFORE THE FIRST SQL STATEMENT IN THE PROGRAM GETS *                                            
   001297               *    EXECUTED.                                                  *                                            
   001298               *****************************************************************                                            
   001299                                                                                                                            
   001300               *****************************************************************                                            
   001301               *    THIS PARAGRAPH BASICALLY DOES THE FOLLOWING:               *                                            
   001302               *                                                               *                                            
   001303               *    RESET THE STATUS-MAP TO INDICATE A GOOD EXECUTION.         *                                            
   001304               *    CHECK TO SEE IF THE CURRENTLY-SET COLLECTION-ID IS THE ONE *                                            
   001305               *    WE NEED TO USE FOR THIS PROGRAM.  IF SO, BYPASS EVERYTHING *                                            
   001306               *    ELSE.  BUT IF NOT, BUILD AND SET THE COLLECTION-ID IN DB2  *                                            
   001307               *    TO THE CORRECT ONE FOR THIS PROGRAM.  ALSO, IF THE PROGRAM *                                            
   001308               *    WASN'T PREVIOUSLY CONNECTED TO DB2, READ THE DB2 CLONE     *                                            
   001309               *    NUMBER BEFORE SETTING THE COLLECTION-ID, THEN AFTER SETTING*                                            
   001310               *    IT (WHICH AUTOMATICALLY PERFORMS THE CONNECT TO DB2),      *                                            
   001311               *    RETRIEVE THE SERVER NAME, USER ID AND SQLID FROM DB2.      *                                            
   001312               *    ANYWHERE ALONG THE WAY, IF ANY STEP GETS A BAD RETURN CODE,*                                            
   001313               *    THEN SET A FLAG FOR THE FAILING STEP IN THE STATUS-MAP,    *                                            
   001314               *    BYPASS ALL THE REMAINING STEPS AND EXIT THE PARAGRAPH.     *                                            
   001315               *                                                               *                                            
   001316               *    NOTE:                                                      *                                            
   001317               *        THE 8-CHAR COLLECTION-ID IS MADE UP OF THE FOLLOWING:  *                                            
   001318               *        THE PROGRAM'S 7-CHAR COLLECTION-ID-BASE CONSTANT AND   *                                            
   001319               *        THE 1-CHAR DB2CLONE NUMBER READ FROM THE FLAT-FILE.    *                                            
   001320               *****************************************************************                                            
   001321               *    DISPLAY '8000-CHECK-DB2-CONNECTION'                                                                     
   001322                    MOVE '00000'             TO  DB85102D-CONNECT-STATUS-MAP              194                               
   001323               *****EXEC SQL                                                                                                
   001324               *****   SET :DB85102D-CURR-COLL-ID = CURRENT PACKAGESET                                                      
   001325               *****END-EXEC                                                                                                
   001326                    MOVE 'CURRENT PACKAGESET'                                                                               
   001327                    TO SQL-TEMP                                                           554                               
   001328                    PERFORM SQL-INITIAL UNTIL SQL-INIT-DONE                               841 562                           
   001329                    CALL 'DSNHLI2' USING SQL-PLIST7                                       EXT 639                           
   001330                    END-CALL                                                                                                
   001331                    IF SQLCODE NOT = ZERO                                                 223 IMP                           
   001332      1                MOVE '2'  TO  DB85102D-CONNECT-STATUS-MAP(2:1)                     194                               
1PP 5655-EC6 IBM Enterprise COBOL for z/OS  6.2.0 P190522       GP004760  Date 02/10/2020  Time 07:53:30   Page    28                
   LineID  PL SL  ----+-*A-1-B--+----2----+----3----+----4----+----5----+----6----+----7-|--+----8 Map and Cross Reference           
0  001333      1                DISPLAY '  DB85102L RECEIVED NON-ZERO SQLCODE '                                                      
   001334      1                        'TRYING TO RETRIEVE COLLECTION-ID '                                                          
   001335      1                        '''' DB85102D-CURR-COLL-ID '''.'                           195                               
   001336      1                DISPLAY ' THE SQLCODE RETURNED WAS : '                                                               
   001337      1                             SQLCODE                                               223                               
   001338                    ELSE                                                                                                    
   001339      1                MOVE DB85102D-CURR-COLL-ID TO DB85102D-PREV-COLL-ID                195 197                           
   001340      1                MOVE DB85102D-CURR-COLL-ID TO DB85102D-TEMP-COLL-ID                195 196                           
   001341                    END-IF                                                                                                  
   001342               *****************************************************************                                            
   001343               *    COMPARE THE FIRST 7 CHARACTERS OF THE CURRENT-COLL-ID WITH *                                            
   001344               *    THE COLL-ID BASE OF THIS PARTICULAR PROGRAM. IF THEY DON'T *                                            
   001345               *    MATCH, THEN EITHER WE AREN'T YET CONNECTED TO DB2 OR WE    *                                            
   001346               *    NEED TO SWITCH TO THE CORRECT COLL-ID FOR THIS PROGRAM.    *                                            
   001347               *    IF THEY DO MATCH, THEN WE CAN BYPASS EVERYTHING ELSE.      *                                            
   001348               *****************************************************************                                            
   001349                    IF DB85102D-CURR-COLL-ID (1:7) NOT =                                  195                               
   001350                                                  300-THIS-PGM-DB2-COLL-ID-BASE           502                               
   001351               *****************************************************************                                            
   001352               *        IF NOT YET CONNECTED TO DB2, THEN READ THE DB2 CLONE   *                                            
   001353               *        NUMBER FROM THE FLAT FILE AND PLUG IT INTO THE 8TH     *                                            
   001354               *        POSITION OF THE COLLECTION-ID.                         *                                            
   001355               *****************************************************************                                            
   001356      1                 IF DB85102D-CURR-COLL-ID  = SPACES  OR  LOW-VALUES                195 IMP IMP                       
